# Repository-level ignores only.
#
# backend/ and frontend/ are self-contained projects and carry their own
# .gitignore for anything language- or build-specific. Keep this file limited to
# things that are genuinely cross-cutting, so neither project depends on rules
# defined above it.

# --- Secrets -----------------------------------------------------------------
# Belt and braces. Each project also ignores its own; this catches a stray .env
# created at the root by mistake.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# --- Editors and IDEs --------------------------------------------------------
.idea/
*.iml
*.ipr
*.iws
.vscode/
!.vscode/extensions.json

# --- OS ----------------------------------------------------------------------
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/
.DS_Store

# --- Logs --------------------------------------------------------------------
*.log
